  "title": "Mexican Potato Nachos",
  "description": "In this Mexican potato nachos recipe, potato slices are the base for hearty beef and bean nachos topped with tomato, lettuce, sour cream, and guacamole.",
  "authors": [
    "Lois A Dupre"
  ],
